e":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":706429,"digest":"sha256:bd6d2164aa52b855611ff080a1711f4e1a88bc325474fb495d9ea446dd1df0c1","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-06-25T18:58:03Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T18:58:04Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/opencost/opencost/releases/download/v1.120.4/opencost-source-sbom.spdx.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencost/opencost/tarball/v1.120.4","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencost/opencost/zipball/v1.120.4","body":"## What's Changed\r\n* Updated UI image build commands from parcel → react-router/vite && Th… by @e-300 in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3827\r\n* Fix custom provider GPU default pricing by @ameijer in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3830\r\n* Bump imjasonh/setup-crane from 0.5 to 0.6 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3837\r\n* move code into OC by @ameijer in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3824\r\n* Add field `queryProjectID` to `BigQueryConfiguration` by @V-3604 in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3821\r\n* protect against nil filter by @ameijer in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3841\r\n* Restore Dockerfile.debug for Tilt development by @Kush172005 in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3844\r\n* Add STACKIT as a cloud provider by @xtavras in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3741\r\n* Fix gofmt alignment in stackit provider test by @cliffcolvin in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3848\r\n* Fix GPUAllocation.Equal to compare pointer field values by @cliffcolvin in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3849\r\n* Support GKE Workload Identity Federation to Provider Pricing Data by @ioboi in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3853\r\n* Bingen 0.1.1 Streaming Writer Support by @mbolt35 in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3836\r\n* feat: expose a step parameter in the get_efficiency tool by @nikita-phantom-ops in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3869\r\n* fix: guard cloudcost Status coverage read and stop ClusterMap ticker by @vtushar06 in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3865\r\n* Reduce spot price auth failure logging by @thomasvn in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3852\r\n* fix(cloud): add timeouts to pricing HTTP clients by @vtushar06 in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3835\r\n* fix(customcost): copy coverage map in Status() to fix data race by @vtushar06 in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3838\r\n* fix(azure): make ondemand pricing OS-aware for Windows nodes by @V-3604 in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3820\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @e-300 made their first contribution in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3827\r\n* @V-3604 made their first contribution in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3821\r\n* @xtavras made their first contribution in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3741\r\n* @nikita-phantom-ops made their first contribution in https://github.com/opencost/opencost/pull/3869\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/opencost/opencost/compare/v1.120.3...v1.120.4","mentions_count":12}